WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- [Kelly] Well,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.340
the series finale of
Supergirl is in a few weeks.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.350
So did you keep anything from
the show? And by that, I mean,

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.380
did you steal anything?

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.765
- [Melissa] I did. I took a
few things, but no, there,

00:00:09.765 --> 00:00:11.940
for some reason the props department,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:15.650
I think found like a tub of
dinosaur figurines somewhere

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.570
and they would just put
them in random places

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:18.842
of the CatCo office set.

00:00:18.842 --> 00:00:19.930
- Wait, what?

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.320
- I don't know.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.560
So I would see them and I had
this weird love of dinosaurs

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.050
as a child. We all
loved dinosaurs as kids,

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.840
but my love of dinosaurs lasted...

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.400
- I loved them as adults in movies

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.848
that his daughter is in, Jurassic World.

00:00:31.848 --> 00:00:32.809
(group chattering)

00:00:32.809 --> 00:00:33.800
- [Melissa] Me too, me too.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.770
Actually Jurassic Park was
a huge reason I loved them.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.298
- [Kelly] Because it's
an amazing franchise.

00:00:38.298 --> 00:00:39.880
- But I wanted to be a paleontologist.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:40.770
- [Kelly] Oh, you were in it?

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.860
- Yeah, I was in it

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.880
until my parents took
us to Dinosaur Ridge in

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.604
Colorado, which is a live dig
and I saw how boring it was.

00:00:49.604 --> 00:00:53.215
(audience laughing)

00:00:53.215 --> 00:00:57.215
- Paleontologist everywhere
were like "whatever"

